	<TEXT>
		<Tag>TXT_KEY_UNIT_AMERICAN_YF23_PEDIA</Tag>
		<English>The Northrop/McDonnell Douglas YF-23 (unofficially nicknamed "Black Widow II" and "Gray Ghost") was an American fifth-generation stealth fighter technology demonstrator for the United States Air Force ATF program. Featuring advanced diamond wings and V-tails, it delivered unprecedented stealth, supercruise speed, and long-range combat capabilities.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]In Civilization IV, the YF-23 is the unique unit for America, replacing the Jet Fighter. It features 28 air combat strength, 12 air range, 2 first strikes, and a 50% evasion rate against anti-air defenses.</English>
